OL,3,GNEWSAMother jailed for killing baby
OL,4,Awith hairdryer abandons appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother found guilty of killing her
OL,7,Fbaby daughter by burning her with a
OL,8,Fhairdryer has abandoned her plans to
OL,9,Fappeal, BBC Scotland News has learned.
OL,11,FCourtney Gartshore, 28, used the
OL,12,Fappliance to subject three-month-old
OL,13,FDahlia-Rose to "significant and
OL,14,Fsustained heat" on her head and body in
OL,15,FPeterhead in 2023.
OL,17,FGartshore was convicted of culpable
OL,18,Fhomicide following a trial at the High
OL,19,FCourt in Aberdeen, and was jailed for
OL,20,Fsix years.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
